    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰπάρᾱ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πᾰ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		 and 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾱό-ρη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαπαρός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the soft part of the body</i> between the ribs
			and hip, <i>flank</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.318
			</span></i>, al. (not in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.86
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i>flanks</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				6.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				193
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Flat.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, etc.; sg. also, <i>side</i> of the chest, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>:— <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαπάρα</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενεών</span> are distd. by <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Int.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).762
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				764
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sausage</i> or <i>haggis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				9.486
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>).</div>
